    "OTA catalog": "",
    "Official ROMs": "",
    "Official ROMs asks these servers in order and uses the first one that answers. Mirrors only list the ROMs; downloads still come from OPPO / OnePlus servers and are checked against the MD5. Only add mirrors you trust.": "",
    "Official ROMs...": "",
    "On China hardware (PJZ110, also when converted to Global) this ROM's own fastboot breaks: its fastbootd restarts by itself and its abl breaks bootloader fastboot. China hardware keeps the phone's Android 16 abl and engineering_cdt, writes the system and firmware from the phone's own (16) recovery's fastbootd first, then the boot images and recovery from the bootloader. The phone must be on Android 16 now. Never relock the bootloader afterwards.": "",
    "One image: a custom recovery, a patched boot, a vbmeta ...": "",
    "Only init_boot / boot of the current slot is written, and the stock image prepared in step 1 is kept for Restore stock image. Make your backups right after rooting.": "",
